{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_12_level_main_12-13_beg",
  "groupId": "main_12",
  "stageId": "main_12-13",
  "title": "千疮百孔",
  "storyCode": "12-15",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-13_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "59aa11d08c23209e54822f7fe5af4fcf0e67e2340dd75a1a1a1aeba228366410",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibtownn"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这次是伊比利亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "耐心些，女妖，我在这里的日子最难忘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以为你不会喜欢那里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在那场灾难发生之前，我确实不喜欢伊比利亚。那些夸夸其谈和自以为是让我腻烦透了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们不懂得畏惧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，那场灾难让你满足了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是老红眼病那样的心理变态，灾难本身也没什么出奇，这片大地何时缺少过灾难？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但那些生物让我着迷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是听说过一些传闻，说实话，那些东西让我十分不安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们与我们过于迥异。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你认为我与你迥异吗，女妖？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你应该知道，无论是哪种样子，都不是真正的我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石在所有人的身上都留下了无可辩驳的烙印，它让你们以现有的样子在世间行走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可它唯独忘记了变形者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唯独我们仍然保存了最初生时的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你会为你的纯洁自豪吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不，当这个世界都已变了样子，纯洁又还有什么意义？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只能追赶它带来的变化，我只能追赶你们。追赶你们所创造的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我用尽了各种办法，我在伊比利亚发现了一个荒废的镇子，我住了进去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们住了进去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们让那座镇子重新运行起来，工作，交流，商业，交通......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "两百个我组成了一个小镇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道你至今都没有陷入疯狂，是你的幸运还是不幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，谁知道呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总之，我在那里度过了印象深刻的一段时光，有那么多的事情要处理，我每天沉溺其中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这给我带来了一种错觉，我们过得有意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，疲乏最终还是到来了，专注于琐事很有趣，但是就算把它们全部加起来，依然无法让我找到答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直到我发现了它们，我听有的人称呼那些东西为“海嗣”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我观察了它们很久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们让你想到了自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，论统一，我们超过了海嗣和它们的那些大群。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论分化为多少形貌，我们始终是统一的，而海嗣，它们只能选择投入大群。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，你知道吗，我羡慕它们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们只需要遵循本能就够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "寻找食物，寻找养分，繁衍，进化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许，你刚刚所说的，“纯洁”这个词，应该放在它们身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我，我留在原地，看着这一切，看着那些多姿多彩的小生物把一片海草同化为它们的一员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们什么都不想，它们做自己该做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我们呢，我们的本能是什么？我们又该做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女妖，你能给我们什么建议？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在笑吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，变形者，我并非在嘲笑你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那位可称最古老的王庭之主的变形者阁下，只是在寻找他生活的意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这很重要，这当然很重要，我只是没想过，站在我面前的，原来是个彷徨的哲学家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你猜，我们在维多利亚的大学当了几年哲学教授？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对于你们而言，寻找意义是简单的，除去那极少部分存在，生命总可称得上短暂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为自己寻找到一个目标，用以填满这些时光没那么难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“伊比利亚人”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我们不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_mini02_victoria_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论是你的提议，还是特雷西斯的未来，我们都没什么兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对于我们而言，都是打发时间罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们为什么要对这些转瞬即逝的东西抱有感情呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们几乎穷尽了一切可能，我们也几乎穷尽了一切乐趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我开始可怜你了，变形者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你发现了我们只是个喊着什么都没劲透了的老家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道这个秘密的人可不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的几个朋友教过我一种愚蠢的游戏......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，还是算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说说吧，女妖，我们比你猜的要有兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，或许得等等了，有个麻烦的工作找上门了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是在这里，但我们恐怕还是得分点心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "37_g6_hotellobby"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有......是什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有就是没有，该死的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "通讯站不在那里，那里什么也没有，有人抢先了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是那些深池的部队吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐怕还要早得多。根据灰尘的厚度判断，诺伯特区刚驶离伦蒂尼姆的时候，就有人盯上那里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那位赤铁近卫队的队长不会真的被我们骗过去的，他很快就会发现预计的通讯没有发出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但最起码，我们又回到同一条起跑线了，大家重新有了挣奖金的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论是服务于开斯特公爵的你，还是深池的鬼魂部队......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们都以秘密潜入的方式进入这个地块，这就说明了，你们想维持诺伯特区表面上的现状。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无法逼迫公爵们的主力部队行动起来，我们的计划就没办法真正实现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别再用这套说辞了，戴菲恩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要你的那位公爵母亲知道你还在这里，她就会想办法来救你的，对吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能保证......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "承认自己和母亲的关系不错没什么丢人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你有办法吗，伊内丝？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "看来你能做到。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我真的很讨厌你这一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，好吧，我会试着去做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我得找个高处，别抱太大希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊内丝小姐，你所说的办法需要多长时间？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到日出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让推进之王和她的市民朋友们做好准备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "考伯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_865_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位，祝你们顺利，希望你们下次还能选择日落街酒店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "考伯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_865_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在这里度过了很美好的时光，我在这里认识了些很不错的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "考伯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_865_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诺伯特区是个生机勃勃的好地方，别让它就这么沦为回忆和废墟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老先生，我们会的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阴谋与纷争终会消弭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有一位......我十分十分想念的人和我说过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许有一天......这片大地上的每一个人，都能平静入梦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "考伯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_865_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，真是折腾，这家酒店又乱了几分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "考伯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_865_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不亲自打扫的人，总是不知道保持一点秩序有多不容易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "考伯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_865_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "珀茜瓦尔！珀茜瓦尔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "考伯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_865_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她又跑到哪里去了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "考伯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_865_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，就让我这个老家伙自己待一会儿吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这位年迈的酒店经理找来了一张同样年迈的扶手椅，选了个舒服的姿势坐了进去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "考伯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_865_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她......那个卡特斯女孩，就是魔王吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "考伯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_865_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "追上这些变化越来越难了，就连我都要为此吃惊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "考伯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_865_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "变化......变化，也许我怠惰于这种变化了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "考伯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_865_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "变化毕竟不是前进。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "考伯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_865_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，也该告别这位老朋友了，说实话......我真的很喜欢这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "考伯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_865_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......考伯特该再坚持两个月的，谁能想到呢，两个月后，萨卡兹的军队进了城，一个魔族佬也能从清洁员变成酒店经理呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "考伯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_865_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我总是弄不懂这些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萨卡兹老人站起身来，巡视着酒店的大堂，这里的每一件物品都与他息息相关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "考伯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_865_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个叫伊内丝的卡普里尼说，战争不配用任何修饰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "考伯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_865_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，就让我们还原它本来的面貌吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在不知被多少政要贵族踏上过的精美编织地毯上，萨卡兹老人丢下一枚点燃的打火机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "随即，火焰熊熊升起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "37_g5_blockadewall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里......这些士兵，都被杀死了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是敌人吗？！如果我早些发现的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们的家属会收到抚恤金，如果有家属的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们必须防备......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的那副表情......你早就知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......这也是你计划的一部分......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是卡兹戴尔军事委员会的安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雇佣兵，牺牲是在所难免的，我以为你的队长早就教过你这一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是个将军，他们是你的士兵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，我是个将军，这就是我的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论是我们的敌人还是我们自己，需要做的事情就是把一个个生命投进这个名为战争的巨口中——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "并祈祷它能吐出让我们称心如意的结果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是以我的立场能做的所有行为。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我会过来，我会过来注视着这一切。看过这里每一张年轻的苍白的脸庞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我必须牢记，这是我做出的决定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不会说这是萨卡兹不得不付出的代价，雇佣兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "维多利亚人杀死了他们，但是是我让他们被维多利亚人杀死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么要这样做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了点燃火焰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "点燃一场遍及这片大地的火焰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我们......萨卡兹，唯有在这样一片纷争的大地上，才有可能找到自己的位置，找到自己生存的空间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雇佣兵，你必须学会熟悉它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "熟悉它，憎恨它，最后接受它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为这是唯一的办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一团明亮的火焰猛然在封锁区中升起，老旧的大楼在熊熊燃烧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又是......火灾吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，那是第一簇火苗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雇佣兵，跟我来吧，我们需要回到飞空艇上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "客人们都已经入席了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
